Package: riskkit
Title: Small Helpers to Turn Odds Ratios into Absolute Risks
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Course", "Author", email = "author@example.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A deliberately tiny teaching package that converts odds ratios
    into absolute risks, given a baseline risk. It accompanies the lessons on
    building R packages for health analyses and shows the standard layout:
    documented functions, input validation, an S3 print method, tests and a
    reproducible example data script. All data are simulated for teaching
    purposes and the package is not intended for clinical use.
